**Completion.** {{done_c08a472}} runs of `c08a472` and {{done_main}} of `main` reached their result line.

**Turn time.** Median seconds per run: `c08a472` {{secs_median_c08a472}}, `main` {{secs_median_main}}.
P18, on its own runs: rank Welch test p {{p18_p}}, A {{p18_A}} (the probability that a run of
